<title>USA: Community Health Systems names new president.</title>
<headline>Community Health Systems names new president.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Health Systems Inc said Tuesday it has named Wayne Smith president of the healthcare services provider.</p>
<p>Most recently, Smith was president and chief operating officer of Humana Inc. He left the company in mid-1996.</p>
<p>Smith succeeds E. Thomas Chaney, a co-founder of Community Health who will remain chief executive.</p>
